"//! AES-256-CBC Continuous IV Chaining Engine for modern DJI flight logs (v13 and v14).
//!
//! Implements multi-tenant domain isolation across 14 FeaturePoints, continuous IV handoff
//! where the trailing 16 bytes of record N's intermediate ciphertext become the initialization
//! vector (IV) for record N+1 on that FeaturePoint, zero-allocation in-place slice mutation,
//! destination-buffer decryption, PKCS#7 slice-based unpadding, and FeaturePoint 8 plaintext bypass.
//!
//! Strictly adheres to `#![deny(unsafe_code)]` with zero `unsafe` blocks.

